TestADMMUnconstrained, test 0:
  TAO solve converged due to CONVERGED_GATOL iterations 102
  Tao Object: 1 MPI process
    type: admm
    ADMM type: min_{x,z} [f(C x; u)] + [0.4 g(D z)]
